{"results":[{"url":"https://tracxn.com/d/legal-entities/india/the-new-era-agencies-pvt-ltd/__NkjxxIgA1WdLeQwwoZHXk5ot8oX-QnWQrZzLexm3fGs","title":"The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd - 2026 Company Profile & Financials - Tracxn","raw_content":"JavaScript is disabled in your browser. enable it to enjoy the full features of Tracxn.\n\n![Tracxn.com](https://cdn.tracxn.com/images/static/tracxn-logo-full-100x22.svg)\n![Android](//cdn.tracxn.com/images/static/downloadSection/Android_App_Icon.svg)\n![Apple](//cdn.tracxn.com/images/static/downloadSection/iOS_App_Icon.svg)\n![Chrome Web Store](//cdn.tracxn.com/images/static/integrations/chromelogo.png)\n![Firefox Extension](//cdn.tracxn.com/images/static/integrations/firefoxlogo.png)\n![tracxn ai suite](https://cdn.tracxn.com/images/static/homepage/tracxn-ai-suit.png)\n\nAI-powered market intelligence across companies, investors, and sectors.\n\n# The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd - Company Profile\n\n## About The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\nThe New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd is a Private Limited Company and was incorporated on Dec 22, 1941 in India. It is registered at Registrar of Companies, ROC Mumbai. Its registered address is 12, FLOOR-4, PLOT-523, KUTCH CASTLE, SARDAR VALLABHBHAI PATEL ROAD, 1st PARSIWADA, OPERA HOUSE, GIRGAON, Girgaon, Mumbai, Mumbai, Maharashtra, India, 400004.  Its corporate identification number is (CIN) U68100MH1941PTC003508 and its current status is Active. Its industry classification as per MCA is other Wholesale [Includes Specialized Wholesale Not Covered In Any One Of The Previous Categories And Wholesale In A Variety Of Goods Without Any Particular Specialization.].\n\nThe New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd's last Annual General Meeting (AGM) was held on Sep 30, 2025 as per records from Ministry of Corporate Affairs (MCA). The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd's authorised share capital is ₹61L and its paid up capital is ₹5L. The current board of directors of The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd comprises [Ravi Mohanlal Jain](https://platform.tracxn.com/a/d/people/6887321cfcddf75a94eda054/ravimohanlaljain) and [Avi Mohanlal Jain](https://platform.tracxn.com/a/d/people/68873224fcddf75a94eda09c/avimohanlaljain).\n\nThe New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd generated less than ₹10 Cr in revenue for the financial year ending on Mar 31, 2025.\n\n## Contact Details for The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\n## Principal Business Activity of The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\n| Main Activity Group Code | Description of Main Activity | Business Activity Code | Description of Business Activity | Turnover Percentage |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| K | Financial and insurance Service | K8 | Other financial activities | xcc |\n\n## Documents of The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd15 mins\n\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n\n## Financials of The New Era Agencies Pvt LtdFY 25 Available15 mins\n\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n\n### Financial Statement Summary\n\n| Metrics | FY 2024-25 | FY 2023-24 | FY 2022-23 | FY 2021-22 | FY 2020-21 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Income Statement |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Revenue | 8032 | 7502 | 1003 | 6758 | 5288 |\n| EBITDA | 8739 | 2633 | 2377 | 6897 | 2755 |\n| Balance Sheet |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Assets | 5464 | 3999 | 5589 | 1680 | 3584 |\n| Liabilities | 4193 | 4182 | 9994 | 3961 | 8871 |\n| Equities | 1867 | 6529 | 1177 | 5192 | 2917 |\n\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n\n### Ratios\n\n| Metrics | FY 2024-25 | FY 2023-24 | FY 2022-23 | FY 2021-22 | FY 2020-21 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Profitability Ratios |  |  |  |  |  |\n| EBITDA Margin | 1290 | 9629 | 3932 | 6838 | 7296 |\n| Efficiency Ratios |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Asset Turnover | 9951 | 6882 | 8923 | 1039 | 1618 |\n| Liquidity Ratios |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Current Ratio | 5489 | 9149 | 2854 | 3141 | 7065 |\n| Quick Ratio | 5861 | 7479 | 6244 | 7105 | 6923 |\n| Growth Ratios |  |  |  |  |  |\n| Revenue Growth Rate (CAGR) | 5464 | 7655 | 7184 | 9625 | 6581 |\n\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n\n### Detailed Financials (Income Statement, Balance Sheet, Cashflow Statement)\n\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n\n### Compounded Annual Growth Rate of The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\n| Revenue CAGR | Growth |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1 Year | 440% |\n| 3 Year | 755 |\n| 5 Year | 613 |\n\n| EBITDA CAGR | Growth |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1 Year | 25% |\n| 3 Year | 312 |\n| 5 Year | 269 |\n\n| Profit CAGR | Growth |\n| --- | --- |\n| 1 Year | 52% |\n| 3 Year | 897 |\n| 5 Year | 912 |\n\n## MSME Payment Delays by The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\n## Related Party Transactions of The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\n## Credit Ratings of The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\n## GSTIN Details of The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\n## Board of Directors and Signatories of The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\n### Board of Directors of The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\n| Name | Designation | Status | Appointment Date | Duration |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| [Ravi Mohanlal Jain](https://platform.tracxn.com/a/d/people/6887321cfcddf75a94eda054/ravimohanlaljain) | Director | Current | Aug 16, 2024 | 1 Year 10 Months |\n| [Avi Mohanlal Jain](https://platform.tracxn.com/a/d/people/68873224fcddf75a94eda09c/avimohanlaljain) | Director | Current | Aug 16, 2024 | 1 Year 10 Months |\n\n## Legal Cases involving The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\n## Trademarks of The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\n## Patents of The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\n## FAQs about The New Era Agencies Pvt Ltd\n\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![Accel Partners](https://cdn.tracxn.com/images/static/homepage/clients/accel_90x90_1x.png \"Accel Partners\")\n![Partech](https://cdn.tracxn.com/images/static/homepage/clients/partech-wbg_90x90_1x.png \"Partech\")\n![IN-Q-TEL - US](https://cdn.tracxn.com/images/static/homepage/clients/iqt_90x90_1x.png \"IN-Q-TEL - US\")\n![Fujitsu](https://cdn.tracxn.com/images/static/homepage/clients/fujitsu_90x90_1x.png \"Fujitsu\")\n![Tenity](https://cdn.tracxn.com/images/sta