m Real Estate Developers Ltd., Malabar Hill, mumbai\n\nCarpet area: **707 sq.ft.**\n\n![Aurum Girnar](/_next/image?url=https%3A%2F%2Fportalassets.beyondwalls.com%2Fproject-assets%2Faurum-girnar%2Fgallery%2Fgallery-0%2F3kLLArh9ksSUDNSUr5whJkD4dgcbsOZo0ltc4zUL.webp&w=1920&q=75)\n\n## [Aurum Girnar](/property/mumbai/malabar-hill/aurum-girnar)\n\n![Share](/images/share.svg)\n![Lodha Malabar](/images/thumbnail.png)\n![Share](/images/share.svg)\n\n## [Lodha Malabar](/property/mumbai/malabar-hill/lodha-malabar)\n\nBy Lodha Group, Malabar Hill, mumbai\n\nCarpet area: **1,291 - 1,978 sq.ft.**\n\n![Lodha Malabar](/images/thumbnail.png)\n\n## [Lodha Malabar](/property/mumbai/malabar-hill/lodha-malabar)\n\n![Share](/images/share.svg)\n\nExplore nearby projects or refine your search for more options.\n\n## Filters\n\n### Project Status\n\n### Configuration Type\n\nLoading configurations...\n\n### Completion Status\n\n### Budget\n\n### Carpet Area (Sq.Ft.)","images":[]},{"url":"https://economictimes.indiatimes.com/company/the-new-era-agencies-pvt-ltd/U51900MH1941PTC003508","title":"THE NEW ERA Agencies PVT LTD  Information - THE NEW ERA Agencies PVT LTD  Company Profile, THE NEW ERA Agencies PVT LTD  News on The Economic Times","raw_content":"![The Economic Times](https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-76931895,quality-100/et-logo.jpg)\n![section logo](https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-76931947,quality-100/et-tech-logo.jpg)\n![More](https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-100067830/et-logo.jpg)\n\n# THE NEW ERA Agencies PVT LTD\n\n## THE NEW ERA Agencies PVT LTD Details\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| CIN | U51900MH1941PTC003508 |\n| Date of Incorporation | 22 Dec, 1941 |\n| Status | Active |\n| Company Category | Company limited by Shares |\n| Company Sub-category | Non-govt company |\n| Company Class | Private |\n| Business Activity | Trading |\n| Authorized Capital | 60.0 lakhs |\n| Paid-up Capital | 5.0 lakhs |\n| Paid-up Capital % | 8.333334 |\n| Registrar Office City | Mumbai |\n| Registered State | Maharashtra |\n| Registration Number | 3508 |\n| Registration Date | 22 Dec, 1941 |\n| Listing Status | Unlisted |\n| AGM last held on | 29 Sep, 2017 |\n| Balance Sheet Date | 31 Mar, 2017 |\n\n## THE NEW ERA Agencies PVT LTD News\n\nNo news available.\n\n\\*Ministry of Corporate Affairs, 2019, Company/LLP Data, (Government of\nIndia administrative body to govern and regulate corporate affairs through the Companies Act 1956 &amp; 2013\nincluding other allied Acts, Bills and Rules) http://www.mca.gov.in/, Updated as on 04 Dec, 2018.\n\nPlease Note: Data on this page may not be updated vis-à-vis company's current credentials.\n\n### THE NEW ERA Agencies PVT LTD Directors\n\n### THE NEW ERA Agencies PVT LTD Contact Details\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Address: | KAMANI CHAMBERS32 R K MARG MUMBAI MH 400038 IN |\n\n### Trending Companies\n\n## Trending in Markets\n\n![The Economic Times](https://img.etimg.com/photo/msid-74462387,quality-100/et-logo.jpg \"The Economic Times\")\n\nQuick Links\n\nPopular Categories\n\nHot on Web\n\nIn Case you missed it\n\nTop Searched Companies\n\nOther useful Links\n\nTop Calculators\n\nLatest News\n\nfollow us on\n\nDownload ET App:","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/project/new-era-kalyan/9635","title":"New Era, Kalyan — resale, rent & RERA | MPE","raw_content":"![Mumbai Property Exchange](/static/images/logo.png)\n![New Era C](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9635/9635-main.webp)\n\n# New Era\n\nAsk an advisor to check current resale or rental availability.\n\n## Gallery\n\n![New Era C](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9635/9635-oth-new-era-elevation-image-1.webp)\n![New Era C](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9635/9635-oth-new-era-elevation-image-2.webp)\n![New Era C](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9635/9635-oth-new-era-elevation-image-3.webp)\n![New Era C](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9635/9635-oth-new-era-elevators.webp)\n![New Era C](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9635/9635-oth-new-era-parking-entrance.webp)\n![New Era C](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9635/9635-oth-new-era-galleria.webp)\n![New Era C](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9635/9635-oth-new-era-garden.webp)\n![New Era C](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9635/9635-oth-new-era-gym.webp)\n![New Era C](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9635/9635-oth-new-era-indoor-hall.webp)\n![New Era C](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9635/9635-oth-new-era-jogging-track.webp)\n![New Era C](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9635/9635-oth-new-era-kids-play-area.webp)\n![New Era C](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/projects/9635/9635-oth-new-era-landscape.webp)\n\n## Overview\n\n**New Era** is a project developed by **Ajmera Group**. New Era is located at Behind Anupam Nagar, Opp. KDMC Bus Depot, Yoga Dham in **Kalyan west**. New Era is 21-storey towers housing 1BHK & 2 BHK flats. New Era has easy access to the market area & it also has the Clubhouse, gymnasium, tennis court & basketball court, Skating ring and Sauna.\n\n**MahaRERA for New Era is P51700014365**\n\n**Highlights of New Era:**\n\n**The property prices in Kalyan** are in the range of 5000 to 6000 for Outright for ready and under construction projects.  \n  \nAjmera Group currently has 4 Under Construction projects.   \n  \n**New Era has good reviews and the ratings of this project are approximately 4 out of 5.**   \n  \n**You\ncan download the brochure  and see video of New Era** and you can see the latest digital\npictures, Floor Plans, Location Plans & Rate History on our\nwebsite.  \nThe Bookings for the Under Construction project New Era are open and we can set up a Site Visit any time at your Convenience.  \nNew Era is approved by most of the Banks and for more details on the approved bank list, please connect with us.\n\n## Possession Timeline\n\n## Unit Configurations (per MahaRERA)\n\n## RERA Trust Record\n\n## Buildings · 1 Wing(s)\n\n## Land DNA · Genesis\n\n## Location\n\n## Promoter & Professionals\n\n## Availability & Pricing\n\n## Construction Progress\n\n## Amenities\n\n## Connectivity\n\n## Talk to our MahaRERA advisor\n\nTell our MahaRERA advisor what you need and they'll guide you on this project.\n\n## Property Rates in Kalyan\n\n## MahaRERA projects nearby in Kalyan\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nAs per MahaRERA, proposed possession is Dec 2021.\n\nYes — MahaRERA registration P51700014365, registered 2021-09-09. The current MahaRERA source record reports no litigations.\n\n1 configuration(s), including 1 BHK of 452 sqft at Call for Price. See the pricing table above.\n\nYogi Developers Corporation\n\nTap WhatsApp or Call below to speak with a Mumbai Property Exchange advisor — serving Mumbai since 1995 · RERA-registered since 2017.\n\n## 📰 Latest Mumbai Property News\n\n![Dhuleva Plans ₹1,000 Crore Redevelopment Near Marine Lines](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/8ab151e7dd57.png)\n![Mumbai MMR Targets $1.5 Trillion Economy by 2047](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/1db71ca6a520.jpg)\n![HC Clears Development of 48-Acre Swadeshi Mills Land in Mumbai](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/0445cfc31f2f.jpg)\n![Kamdhenu Realities Buys 4-Acre Navi Mumbai Land for ₹150 Crore](https://www.mumbaipropertyexchange.com/img/news/06ac4371a40f.jpg)\n![Mumbai Property Exchange](/static/images/logo.png)\n\nMumbai real-estate consultancy since 1995 · RERA-registered since 2017 — helping you find your dream property in Mumbai.\n\n## Properties\n\n## Buyer Tools\n\n## Market Intelligence\n\n## Company","images":[]},{"url":"https://haryanarera.gov.in/view_project/searchprojectDetail/3384","title":"Haryana Real Estate Regulatory Authority","raw_content":"### Password Policy\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| 1.Password must at least be 8 characters. |\n| 2.Password must not be the same as the previous 3 passwords. |\n| 3.Password must contain Uppercase, lower case, number and Special Characters. |\n| 4.If you do not set the password correctly, a message will be flashed \"Your password is not as per Password Policy.\" This implies that the password needs to be set again as per the guidelines stated above. |\n\nComprehensive Project Details\n\nProject Location Details\n\n| Project Name | Project Location | Project District | Project Tehsil | Promoter Name |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| New Era City | Village Kassar and Sarai Aurangabad, Sector-3A | JHAJJAR | Bahadurgarh | New Era Planners Pvt Ltd |\n\nProject Detail\n\n| Project Registration Number | Project Id | Receiving Date | Online Submission Date | Current Status | Next Date of Hearing | Notice Dispatched | Notice Dispatched On | Notice Tracking Id | Notice Dispatched Remarks | View Notice | Initially Scrutinized Remarks | Details of Project(Form A-H) |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| HRERA-PKL-JJR-697-2025 | RERA-PKL-1656-2025 | 27-Mar-2025 | 25-Mar-2025 | APPROVED AND CERTIFICATE UPLOADED | NOT REQUIRED | Not Yet | -- | listed for 09-04-2025 | [View Form(A-H)](https://haryanarera.gov.in/view_project/project_preview_open/3384) |\n\nProject Approval Status\n\n| Project Registration Number | Approval Date | Approval Remarks | View Certificate |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| HRERA-PKL-JJR-697-2025 | 22-May-2025 | RC Approved. |  |\n\nProject Listing Details\n\n| Date of Hearing | Proceedings of the day | Status | Order |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 23-Apr-2025 | APPROVED AND READY FOR CERTIFICATE ISSUING PROCESS. | APPROVED AND READY FOR CERTIFICATE ISSUING PROCESS | [View Order](https://haryanarera.gov.in/view_project/viewOrderPdf/NjEyNw==) |\n| 09-Apr-2025 | Listed for hearing on 23.04.2025. | EXAMINATION BY AUTHORITY | [View Order](https://haryanarera.gov.in/view_project/viewOrderPdf/NjA4Mw==